#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:6
msgid "Gemini"
msgstr "Gemini"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:7
msgid "Office Suite"
msgstr "Uredski paket"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:9
msgid "The KDE Office suite for 2-in-1 devices. 2-in-1 devices which can act as both a touch only tablet and a classic clamshell notebook are fast becoming very popular, and after the success of Krita Gemini, the team behind it realised there were plenty of reasons to apply that same concept to other applications, and especially the others in the Calligra suite. In particular the word processor component Words and presentation tool Stage were deemed ripe for this treatment."
msgstr "KDE-ov uredski paket za uređaje 2-u-1. Uređaji 2-u-1, koji mogu služiti kao tableti s upravljanjem dodirom ili klasična prijenosna računala na preklop, brzo postaju vrlo popularni. Nakon uspjeha aplikacije Krita Gemini, njezin je razvojni tim uvidio da postoji mnogo razloga za primjenu istog koncepta na druge aplikacije, osobito one iz paketa Calligra. Posebno su prikladnima za to smatrane komponente Words za obradu teksta i Stage za prezentacije."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:10
msgid "With that realisation was born the desire to create Calligra Gemini, an application encasing word processor and presentation components which would function both as a traditional desktop application with a mouse and keyboard, and transform into a touch friendly application on the go, changing the experience to one suitable for all-touch devices without the inconvenience of having to switch to a different application."
msgstr "Iz te se spoznaje rodila želja za stvaranjem aplikacije Calligra Gemini koja objedinjuje komponente za obradu teksta i izradu prezentacija. Ona bi radila kao tradicionalna stolna aplikacija s mišem i tipkovnicom, a u pokretu bi se pretvorila u aplikaciju prilagođenu dodiru. Tako bi pružala iskustvo prikladno za uređaje kojima se upravlja isključivo dodirom, bez neugodnosti prelaska na drugu aplikaciju."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:11
msgid "The Gemini applications combine the power of Calligra's main applications (in Calligra Gemini's case the main office desktop applications, at the moment Words and Stage), with pleasant and explicitly touch optimised experiences based around the same document types."
msgstr "Aplikacije Gemini spajaju mogućnosti glavnih aplikacija Calligre (u slučaju Calligre Gemini riječ je o glavnim uredskim aplikacijama za stolna računala, trenutačno Wordsu i Stageu) s ugodnim iskustvom rada posebno prilagođenim dodiru, uz iste vrste dokumenata."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:12
msgid "Calligra itself is a large suite of applications, split into three main categories: Office applications, Graphics Applications and Project Management. Please visit the Calligra website to see full descriptions of the many tools."
msgstr "Calligra je opsežan paket aplikacija podijeljenih u tri glavne kategorije: uredske aplikacije, grafičke aplikacije i upravljanje projektima. Posjetite web-mjesto Calligre za cjelovite opise brojnih alata."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:14
msgid "Common Features"
msgstr "Zajedničke značajke"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:16
msgid "The applications in the Calligra Suite shares some common UI concepts that gives it a modern look better suited for the wide screens of today. One of them is that most formatting is done using dockers which are placed at the side of the windows instead of on the top. This makes more space available for the actual document contents and avoids opening dialogs on top of it. If the user chooses, s/he can rearrange the placement of the dockers around the document area or even tear loose them and let them float freely. The arrangement is saved and reused the next time Calligra is opened."
msgstr "Aplikacije paketa Calligra dijele zajedničke koncepte korisničkog sučelja koji im daju moderan izgled, prikladniji za današnje široke zaslone. Jedan je od njih većina oblikovanja koja se obavlja pomoću priključnih prozora smještenih uz rubove prozora, umjesto na vrhu. Time se oslobađa više prostora za sadržaj dokumenta i izbjegava otvaranje dijaloga preko njega. Korisnik po želji može premjestiti priključne prozore oko područja dokumenta ili ih odvojiti i pustiti da slobodno plutaju. Raspored se sprema i ponovno koristi pri sljedećem pokretanju Calligre."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:18
msgid "Embeddable Objects"
msgstr "Ugradivi objekti"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:20
msgid "There are many objects and shapes that you can insert into your document, such as geometric shapes, sheet music score, and many more amazing options. All of these shapes are available in all applications, which makes implementing these objects much easier."
msgstr "U dokument možete umetnuti brojne objekte i oblike, kao što su geometrijski oblici, notni zapisi i mnoge druge mogućnosti. Svi su ti oblici dostupni u svim aplikacijama, što znatno olakšava njihovu primjenu."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:22
msgid "Standard file format"
msgstr "Standardni format datoteke"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:24
msgid "Calligra uses the Open Document Format (ODF) as its main file format which makes it compatible with most other office applications including OpenOffice.org, LibreOffice and Microsoft Office. It can also import the native file formats of Microsoft Office with great accuracy, in many cases the best you can find."
msgstr "Calligra kao glavni format datoteka koristi Open Document Format (ODF), zbog čega je kompatibilna s većinom drugih uredskih aplikacija, uključujući OpenOffice.org, LibreOffice i Microsoft Office. Također može vrlo precizno uvoziti izvorne formate datoteka sustava Microsoft Office, u mnogim slučajevima bolje od drugih dostupnih rješenja."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.calligra.gemini.metainfo.xml:31
msgid "A presentation loaded directly from DropBox, in Edit mode"
msgstr "Prezentacija izravno učitana s Dropboxa u načinu uređivanja"

